<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Aquila Gas cut - source.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aquila Gas cut - source.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette downgraded Aquila Gas Pipeline Corp to market perform from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $0.90 a share from $1.30 a share and trimmed the 1998 estimate to $1.05 a share from $1.40 a share, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Aquila lost 14/16 to 11-11/16.</p>
</text>
